    <briefdescription>
<para>This cast trait provides std::optional&lt;T&gt; casting. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This means that if you have a value type, you can cast it to another value type and have dyn_cast return an std::optional&lt;T&gt;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
